      "id": "claim_c8c20345dd9340feb96ba2427b432202",
      "statement": "During graph assembly, interrupt-mode filesystem permissions become per-tool HumanInTheLoopMiddleware routing predicates; exact calls honor deny over interrupt, while bulk calls conservatively interrupt when their reachable subtree can overlap an interrupt rule.",
